{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2025-09", "window": 4, "start_date": 1758585600, "end_date": 1759276799, "month_true_total": 78, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 18:07:26 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "205569347", "author": {"steamid": "76561199035572927", "personaname": "Tancho", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199035572927/", "num_games_owned": 301, "num_reviews": 242, "playtime_forever": 332, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 332, "last_played": 1769961083, "avatar": "a41bba94e272038c2f62d704f0b8e689592e52e3"}, "language": "english", "review": "For the Emperor\n\nThis game came in 2011? thats tough. So playing this after space marine 2 you can definetly see the difference, well duh. HOWEVER, this is really good game. Its chaotic and Fun. Challenging even in normal mode. Story is there. graphic is not that bad for that time period. crashed just one time but save point is frequent so no worries.\n\n4/5", "timestamp_created": 1759263024, "timestamp_updated": 1769961986, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.581749081611633301", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "205525572", "author": {"steamid": "76561197988850970", "personaname": "Rick O The Terrible", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/rickotheterrible/", "num_games_owned": 347, "num_reviews": 160, "playtime_forever": 483, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 232, "last_played": 1759547656, "avatar": "56f38b91a890f8456172fe7cb99d8f8dc72892a9"}, "language": "english", "review": "More than Perfect addition to the WarHammer Universe for sure", "timestamp_created": 1759216303, "timestam